# embry0 frontend env vars. Copy to .env (gitignored) for local dev.
# All VITE_* vars are inlined into the bundle at build time.
#
# RAV-1058: the API key is NOT a build-time var anymore — the dashboard
# prompts for it at runtime (AuthGate) and stores it in the browser. There is
# no VITE_API_KEY. This file is intentionally left without secrets.
